{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object visible, approach and pick it up. Check properties and move to destination in order to complete task. Scan area otherwise.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = PickUpObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectReached    /> <SubTree ID = PickUpObjectTask    /> (this SubTree is assumed to contain general task flow of picking up an object)",
